  "prefLabel": "Puc 2002.01 Aggregate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2002.01 “Aggregate” means to combine the electricity loads of 2 or more customers or a single customer with multiple meters or multiple locations.\n\nSource. #7758, eff 9-4-02; ss by #9774-A, eff 8-26-10; ss by #12372, eff 11-1-17; ss by #14576, eff 5-13-26, EXPIRES: 5-13-36 (formerly Puc 2002.01 and Puc 2002.02)",
